000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.    TPRTRPT.
000400 AUTHOR.        C.I.HILLES.
000500*REMARKS.
000600**************************************************************
000700*                                                            *
000800*    T P R T R P T                                           *
000900*                                                            *
001000* THIS PROGRAM PRINTS A REPORT HELD IN A DISK FILE TO A      *
001100* PRINTER. CONTROL JCW'S USED:                               *
002300*                                                            *
003300*   1. PRTNUM:      PRINTER NUMBER TO PRINT AT.              *
003400*      FOR HP IT IS THE LOGICAL DEVICE NUMBER.  FOR IBM      *
003500*      IT IS THE PRT FILE NUMBER (IE PRTNUM = 25 MEANS       *
003600*      USE FILE 'MCPRT25'. DEFAULT IS SYSTEM LINE PRINTER.   *
004300*                                                            *
      *   2. COMPRESS-FLAG:  Y/1 = COMPRESS, N/0 = DON'T           *
      *                                                            *
      *   3. RDATES:  Y/1 = BRING UP RANGE OF DATES SCREEN FOR     *
004400*      A CIRCULAR REPORT FILE, N/0 = PRINT ENTIRE FILE.      *
      *                                                            *
      *   4. TODAY:   Y/1 = NO SCREEN, BUT PRINT ONLY TODAY'S      *
      *      REPORT FROM THE CIRCULAR FILE, N/0 = DON'T            *
      *                                                            *
      * IN THE REPORT FILE, THE FIRST BYTE 'CTL' IS USED AS A      *
      * CONTROL CHARACTER.  '0' MEANS NEW-PAGE, ANY OTHER NUMBER   *
      * MEANS ADVANCE THAT MANY LINES.                             *
000600**************************************************************
      *C
      *C  11/07/1997    CA YODER
      *C    MODIFIED PROGRAM FOR CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.
      *C
      *C  12/03/1997    CA YODER   REQ #97-014
      *C    MODIFIED PROGRAM TO RECOGNIZE THE "D" CONTROL CHARACTER
      *C    WHICH MEANS THAT THE REPORT WILL BE DISTRIBUTED BY
      *C    DEPARTMENT, OR WHATEVER KEY IS DEFINED TO THE REPORT
      *C    DISTRIBUTION PROGRAM.
      *C    - IF THE REPORT IS TO BE DISTRIBUTED IN THIS WAY, A SWITCH
      *C      AFTER THE DATE IN THE "*" RECORD WILL BE SET TO "Y."
      *C      THIS WILL CAUSE THE PROGRAM TO SKIP THE FIRST OVERRIDE
      *C      AND JUST OVERRIDE ACCORDING TO THE PRINTERS IN MCFPCS6800.
      *C    - BEFORE EACH PAGE, THE REPORT ID AND THEN THE KEY VALUE
      *C      WILL FOLLOW THE "D" CONTROL CHARACTER.  THE PROGRAM
      *C      "SGETRPT" WILL THEN LOOK UP WHAT PRINTER TO OVERRIDE TO.
      *C      IF BOTH THE KEY VALUE AND THE DEFAULT VALUE ARE NOT
      *C      FOUND IN MCFPCS6800, THE PROGRAM WILL REVERT BACK TO THE
      *C      MCPRT FILE PASSED TO THIS PROGRAM.
      *C
      *C  01/26/1998     CA YODER
      *C      ADDED LOGIC TO MAKE SURE THERE IS A DATE ALONG WITH THE
      *C      "*" CONTROL CHARACTER.  IN ONE PROGRAM, AN ASTERISK WAS
      *C      BEING WRITTEN TO THE CONTROL CHARACTER WITHOUT A VALID
      *C      DATE.  THIS CAUSED THE DATE TO EVAULATE TO A "20??????"
      *C      DATE, WHICH WAS ALWAYS LARGER THAN THE CURRENT DATE
      *C      (AT LEAST UNTIL AFTER THE YEAR 2000), SO THE WHOLE FILE
      *C      COULD BE PRINTED IF THE ASTERISK APPEARED EARLY ENOUGH
      *C      IN A FILE.
      *C
      *C  01/03/2003    DAVE PLUM
      *C      ADDED LOGIC TO HANDLE THE CASE WHERE:
      *C        1) THE FIRST RECORD IN THE REPORT FILE INDICATES THAT
      *C           WE ARE TO DISTRIBUTE REPORTS BY DEPARTMENT
      *C           (FOR EXAMPLE "*030103Y")
      *C        AND
      *C        2) THE REPORT FILE ONLY CONTAINS THIS ONE CONTROL
      *C           RECORD.  (THERE ARE NO REPORT RECORDS TO DISTRIBUTE.)
      *C      THIS SITUATION OCCURRED IN LAWTON OVER A HOLIDAY WHEN
      *C      PROGRAM TDLYCHGS READ AN ABSTFILE THAT CONTAINED ZERO
      *C      "DAILY CHARGES" TYPE RECORDS.  IN THIS CASE, TDLYCHGS ONLY
      *C      WROTE THE SINGLE CONTROL RECORD TO THE FILE DDLYCHGS WHICH
      *C      IS USED BY THIS PROGRAM AS THE REPORT FILE.
      *C
      *C  05/09/2003    BRUCE GEISER
      *C      ADDED LOGIC TO MAKE SURE THE PRINT FILE WAS OPENED BEFORE
      *C      WRITING RECORDS.
      *C
009500 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
009600 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
009700 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
009800 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
       COPY SPECIALN IN COPYLIB.
009900
010400 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
010500 FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT PRINT-FILE    ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT.
           SELECT REPORT-FILE   ASSIGN TO DISK-MCFPRPT
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT REPRINT-FILE  ASSIGN TO DISK-MCFPREPRT.

           SELECT MPLTINFO-PK-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
               ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZPRTRPT-SI
               ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
               ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
               CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.

011100 DATA DIVISION.
011200 FILE SECTION.
011300
011400 FD PRINT-FILE
011500     LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED
011600     RECORD CONTAINS 132 CHARACTERS
011700     DATA RECORD IS PRT-REC.
011800 01  PRT-REC              PIC X(132).
011900
012600 FD  REPORT-FILE
012700     LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED
012800     RECORD CONTAINS 133 CHARACTERS
012900     DATA RECORD IS REPORT-REC.
013000 01  REPORT-REC.
           05  CTL-X                      PIC X(1).
013100     05  CTL REDEFINES CTL-X        PIC 9.
013200     05  REPORT-LINE.
013300         10  CTL-DATE               PIC X(6).
               10  CTL-DIST-SW            PIC X.
013400         10  FILLER                 PIC X(125).
013500
013600 FD  REPRINT-FILE
013700     LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED
013800     RECORD CONTAINS 80 CHARACTERS
013900     DATA RECORD IS REPRINT-REC.
014000 01  REPRINT-REC.
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(12).
014100     05  REPRINT-RNUM              PIC X(2).
014200     05  REPRINT-RNAME             PIC X(35).
014300     05  REPRINT-FNAME             PIC X(26).
014400     05  FILLER                    PIC X(5).
014600
      *------ FD STATEMENT AREA FOR IBM ONLY ------*
       FD  MPLTINFO-PK-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-PK-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0500  OF MCFLCS0501.

       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC        PIC X(2000).

      *------ FD STATEMENT AREA FOR IBM ONLY ------*
014700 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77  COMPRESS-FLAG           PIC X(1).
015000 77  EOF                     PIC S9(9) BINARY VALUE ZEROS.
015300 77  SUB                     PIC S9(4) BINARY VALUE 0.
       77  FOUND-FLAG              PIC X(1).
015700 77  END-OF-READ             PIC X(1)       VALUE "N".
015800 77  FILE-EOF                PIC X(1).
       77  END-RPT                 PIC X(1).
015900 77  DATES-FLAG              PIC X(1)       VALUE "N".
016000 77  TODAY-FLAG              PIC X(1)       VALUE "N".
       77  HOLD-LDEV               PIC 9(2).
       77  LAST-LDEV               PIC 9(2).
       77  HOLD-DIST-SW            PIC X          VALUE "N".
       77  PRINTER-OPEN-SW         PIC X          VALUE "N".

       01  BEGIN-DATE-CN.
           05  BEGIN-DATE-CC       PIC X(2).
           05  BEGIN-DATE-YMD.
               10  BEGIN-DATE-YY   PIC X(2).
               10  BEGIN-DATE-MM   PIC X(2).
               10  BEGIN-DATE-DD   PIC X(2).

       01  END-DATE-CN.
           05  END-DATE-CC         PIC X(2).
           05  END-DATE-YMD.
               10  END-DATE-YY     PIC X(2).
               10  END-DATE-MM     PIC X(2).
               10  END-DATE-DD     PIC X(2).

       01  EARLIEST-DATE-CN.
           05  EARLIEST-DATE-CC       PIC X(2).
           05  EARLIEST-DATE-YMD.
               10  EARLIEST-DATE-YY   PIC X(2).
               10  EARLIEST-DATE-MM   PIC X(2).
               10  EARLIEST-DATE-DD   PIC X(2).

       01  HOLD-CTL-DATE-CN.
           05  HOLD-CTL-DATE-CC       PIC X(2).
           05  HOLD-CTL-DATE-YMD.
               10  HOLD-CTL-DATE-YY   PIC X(2).
               10  HOLD-CTL-DATE-MM   PIC X(2).
               10  HOLD-CTL-DATE-DD   PIC X(2).

       01  RPT-DIST-LINE.
           05  RPT-ID                 PIC X(4).
           05  RPT-KEY                PIC X(10).

      *------- PARAMETERS FOR "SGETRPT" TO GET REPORT DISTRIBUTION
      *------- INFORMATION.
       01  SGETRPT-PARMS.
           05  SGETRPT-PGM              PIC X(8).
           05  SGETRPT-ID               PIC X(4).
           05  SGETRPT-SW               PIC X.
           05  SGETRPT-KEY              PIC X(10).
           05  SGETRPT-PRINTER          PIC X(2).

017400*************************************************************
